m forcing the glacial.** So the EFE can't flow uphill to an un-registered capability *because the structure has no edge there.* The consent-gate (INV-G) is the belt; **gradient-intrinsic exogeneity is the trousers** — and it was already in the library.\n\n## The four load-bearing patterns\n1. **`structural-tension-as-observation`** — the I4 exogeneity = the gradient-intrinsic safety, made structural.\n2. **`task-as-arrow`** (BHK) — off-goal capabilities are arrows that **don't compose into the ascent** → *not forbidden, not wireable*. EFE slopes toward composable proof-chains.\n3. **`theory-as-exotype`** — node = generalised exotype; **toposort is a structural type constraint**, not metadata (a capability ships only if it type-checks).\n4. **`retroactive-canonicalization`** + `evidence-over-assertion` + `mandatory-psr/pur` — INV-2 mint-provenance is an existing discipline (every capability claim has an auditable genealogy → the perfect-crime check at the capability level).\n\n(All 14 cited patterns verified to exist — the perfect-crime discipline applied to my own citations.)\n\n## Plain-language (the ARGUE exit)\n> The map shows the big unbuilt things *and* the small ready next steps, so the overnight builder picks a small ready one on its own. It's safe because the builder only ever rolls **downhill** toward goals you pre-registered — it can *notice* it lacks an ability but can't *decide on its own* to chase one, because there's no downhill path to anything you didn't write down. Water doesn't flow uphill.\n\n## Next: VERIFY — and the ARGUE told us how\nThe cross-reference surfaced our own `mission-coherence/logic-model-before-code` discipline, which is exactly the right VERIFY: model **INV-1..INV-G as a `core.logic` + pldb model over an abstract trace, *before* any code** — a conforming witness trace plus one adversarial trace per invariant. The one I most want machine-checked is **INV-G**: prove that (a) discovery can never advance to pursuit without a pre-registered/consented target, and (b) the EFE can't select an un-registered capability (the off-goal arrow doesn't compose). That's the safety guarantee made *checkable*, not just argued.\n\nWant me to run VERIFY (write the logic-model), or pressure-test the ARGUE first?",
